4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p3F8LtZBHMwQ7kNvwH7ATaC&_nc_oc=Adr-ThaWKKV_wcuHfal5FV6NowBzl_GEsUgh3u2dGjiWXiri-ssTPkVVptEeLnLdKkA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afzm5bgpnPADrJV9cv4xfXBtm-cv-XETmpx5dcqm39jwJA&oe=69C3DD54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=t757DALxpV0Q7kNvwH7PLDq&_nc_oc=Ado9CNT2Xi9Lz5IecfIAtxkN1JE7XSjoWoJzgSYxPpEaF-vjQeWxiXANULbXYrasexI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwnOyRtrDYnRm8CIsjti1m0Ibk_XoW8VPtt1u2kEhvk1A&oe=69C3E232"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uudlYoCH4ZoQ7kNvwH8KKga&_nc_oc=Adp3rPFDeJiiyCM3Dcxsk9GsWvQmWk_3_aA6D_8e6l0w107UJtFISQ6a0KzJqiUw_hg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwANdJiqrXjREITIWAGNZW7jKfFDQJinF-AQrai3KneGQ&oe=69C3EFD5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p